===Noun===
{{en-noun|emboli}}

# {{pathology}} An obstruction causing an [[embolism]]: a [[blood clot]], air bubble or other matter carried by the [[blood stream]] and causing a blockage or [[occlusion]] of a [[blood vessel]].

